  "question": {
    "text": "The chords passing through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> intersect the hyperbola <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> at <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The locus of the point of intersection of tangents at <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math> on the hyperbola is"
  },
